PclMemOpt
Copyright 2026 DreamRealm-Dev

This product is an independent command-line tool that reimplements the
"memory optimization" feature (百宝箱 -> 内存优化) that used to ship with PCL-CE
and was removed in PCL-CE v2.15.0-beta.3 (PR #3067).

