2. Modifications  (Apache License 2.0, section 4(b))
===============================================================================

This is NOT the upstream software, and it has NOT been reviewed, approved or
endorsed by the PCL-CE maintainers or by 龙腾猫跃. It is not affiliated with
either project.

Changes made relative to PCL-CE:

  * the memory operations were ported from launcher (VB.NET) code into a
    standalone C# command-line tool targeting .NET 10;
  * the dedicated elevation child process (PromoteService) was replaced with
    process self-restart via runas;
  * CLI argument parsing was added, along with --loop / --dry-run /
    --no-elevate, per-step timing, NTSTATUS reporting and exit codes;
  * all launcher functionality was removed -- there is no Minecraft launching,
    downloading, mod management, GUI or theming of any kind.

See README.md, section "与 PCL-CE 原实现的差异", for the complete diff table.
